+# Plan: Rental Module
+**Spec**: spec.md
+
+## Constitution Check (before and after design)
+- No runtime deps: pass. Strict ESM TS, `.js` imports: pass. Tests with node:test: pass (see below).
+- Domain rules explicit, no clock or time-zone dependence (UTC parsing only): pass. Small change: pass.
+
+## Design
+- `src/index.ts`: types, `parsePeriod` (pure), `createRentalService`, all in one file so that Node can run the TypeScript directly (a `.js` specifier does not resolve to a `.ts` file).
+- Overlap: existing.start < new.end && new.start < existing.end.
+- Tests in `test/rental.test.ts` import `../src/index.ts`; run by `node --test` using Node's built-in TypeScript type stripping (no dependency). Fallback: compile with tsc to dist if the Node version lacks it.
+- `typescript`/`@types/node` are not needed to be added; none added.
